{
  "id": 312827990,
  "iid": 16269,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "exported_pdu: Pad TCP_INFO_DATA to 32-bit boundary",
  "description": "According to the exported_pdu protocol definition, all variable-length\ntag values should be 32-bit aligned. The struct tcpinfo is 19 octet\nlong. One additional octet should be added as padding at the end.\n\nNote: The dissector works in any case because the 32-bit alignment is\nnot enforced.\n\nThis should fix [the sample file included in the wiki](https://wiki.wireshark.org/Protocols/exported_pdu#example-capture-file).\n[http_pdus_fix.pcapng](/uploads/78adac9a3c372a6f2be73415b7cfa2bf/http_pdus_fix.pcapng)",
  "state": "merged",
