          "noteable_iid": 16269,
          "commands_changes": {}
        },
        {
          "id": 1983426386,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "It looks like the tag itself (id and length) is written by the `exp_pdu_populate_data` function, not by `export_pdu_create_tags()`.\n\nThe calling code is responsible for appropriate padding when writing the tag in the `exp_pdu_populate_data` function **and** when reporting the size in the `exp_pdu_get_size` function.\n\nI have updated the merge request to keep `EXP_PDU_TCP_INFO_DATA_LEN` equal to 19.",
          "author": {
            "id": 20332936,
            "username": "nazardo",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Mauro Levra",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://gitlab.com/uploads/-/system/user/avatar/20332936/avatar.png?v=1778573580",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/nazardo"
          },
          "created_at": "2024-07-04T14:55:12.055Z",
          "updated_at": "2024-07-05T14:54:21.352Z",
          "system": false,
          "noteable_id": 312827990,
