        "43fe6bcdad63165f57d441ad754b9451ef5376b5"
      ],
      "title": "exported_pdu: Pad TCP_INFO_DATA to 32-bit boundary",
      "message": "exported_pdu: Pad TCP_INFO_DATA to 32-bit boundary\n\nAccording to the exported_pdu protocol definition, all variable length\ntag values should be 32-bit aligned. The struct tcpinfo is 19 octet\nlong. One additional octet should be added as padding at the end.\n\nNote: The dissector works in any case because the 32-bit alignment is\nnot enforced.\n",
      "author_name": "Mauro Levra",
      "author_email": "mauro@nazardo.it",
      "authored_date": "2024-07-05T09:54:29.000+02:00",
      "committer_name": "Pascal Quantin",
      "committer_email": "pascal@wireshark.org",
      "committed_date": "2024-07-05T15:08:38.000+00:00",
